stress.txt.gz is a subset of the stress dictionary of RUAccent and accent.onnx
is its nn_accent/model.onnx, both from https://huggingface.co/ruaccent/accentuator
(revision b78ae5ea1e62beaf138bed1865cd8c3b0b5ca855), https://github.com/Den4ikAI/ruaccent.
